      "reference_text_zh": "*2級變化學派特性*\n\n你在將變化系法術抄寫進你的法術書時所必須花費的金錢和時間減半。",
      "automation_boundary": "structured_manual"
    }
  },
  {
    "key": "phb2014:feature:trickery-1-blessing-of-the-trickster",
